--TEST--
a `Core` method is declared outside the workspace, so renaming it is refused with a message the editor shows, `rule:ide/no-refactoring-introduces-an-alias`
--FILE--
<?nvs
var $count = Core\Str::len<|>gth("hello");
echo $count;
--REQUEST--
rename to=size
--EXPECT--
refused: `Core\Str::length` is declared outside this workspace, so it cannot be renamed.
